# Styling

- Style with MUI `sx` and theme tokens (`palette`, `typography`, `breakpoints`, `shape`). Prefer `primary`, `secondary`, `sea`, `sand` over one-off hex.
- Theme lives in `src/theme/theme.ts` (`cssVariables: true`). Wrap the tree with `ThemeRegistry`.
- Do not add Tailwind, CSS Modules, or a second styling library.
- Use `@mui/icons-material` for UI icons. Do not add Phosphor or other icon packs unless asked.
- `button.textTransform` is already `"none"` on the theme — do not override it back to uppercase.
- Accept optional `sx?: SxProps<Theme>` on reusable components that parents may need to override.
